      "value": "One can hope, but it seems a bit unlikely because of what pi responded about potential VRC Light Volumes support in Mobile Toon Standard (9 May 2025):\n\n> *probably* not, community things have implications, both for maintenance and performance, that we don't want to have at this time\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/sdk-381-beta4-support-vrc-light-volumes-in-toon-standard",
